      "text": "P_i = mean_amp_i / sum(all)\nNow a probability distribution\nIf uniform: no coupling\nIf non-uniform: PAC exists",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P_i = mean_amp_i / sum(all)\nNow a probability distribution\nIf uniform: no coupling\nIf non-uniform: PAC exists",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
