      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1709000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Epoch-level PAC labeling: all 2s windows\n   in same epoch share ONE PAC value\n2. Only 7 frontal channels at 250 Hz\n3. Individual variability across 35 patients\n4. Need to change the QUESTION, not the model\n   --> This led to the TEMPORAL PIVOT",
