      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1294,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1709000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Initial R2 = 0.69 (exciting!) --> Checked feature correlations --> PAC-derived features in input had r=0.73 with target\nRidge analysis: PAC features carried 96.6% of model weight --> After removing: R2 = 0.236 (worse than EEGNet)\nLESSON: Always check for leakage. High R2 + high feature-target correlation = smell test failure.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Initial R2 = 0.69 (exciting!) --> Checked feature correlations --> PAC-derived features in input had r=0.73 with target\nRidge analysis: PAC features carried 96.6% of model weight --> After removing: R2 = 0.236 (worse than EEGNet)\nLESSON: Always check for leakage. High R2 + high feature-target correlation = smell test failure.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
